Package: openreader
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: OpenReader contributors <dev@openreader.local>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libasound2t64 | libasound2, pipewire-alsa, xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-kde, libkf6config-bin
Recommends: tesseract-ocr, tesseract-ocr-deu
Description: Wayland-first AI text-to-speech reader for Linux
 OpenReader shows a small overlay when text is selected and reads it aloud
 using local AI TTS engines.
